{
  "id": "best_ending",
  "title": "Best Ending - Post-Credits",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "text": "[Post-credits. The screen stays black longer than it should. Then—]",
      "portrait": "",
      "next": "line_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_2",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "text": "[A beach. An island. The sound of chains.]",
      "portrait": "",
      "next": "line_3"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_3",
      "speaker": "Escaped Slave",
      "text": "You came.",
      "portrait": "slave_gaunt",
      "next": "line_4"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_4",
      "speaker": "Kella",
      "text": "Someone had to.",
      "portrait": "kella_grim",
      "next": "line_5"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_5",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "text": "[Kella looks out at the island. The slavers don't know they're here. Not yet.]",
      "portrait": "",
      "next": "line_6"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_6",
      "speaker": "Kella",
      "text": "Alright. One more job. Then we go home.",
      "portrait": "kella_determined",
      "next": "party_check"
    },
    {
      "id": "party_check",
      "type": "branch",
      "conditions": [
        { "flag": "michael_recruited", "goto": "michael_comment" }
      ],
      "default": "slaver_island_start"
    },
    {
      "id": "michael_comment",
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "text": "Last time you said that, it took six months and we fought a god.",
      "portrait": "michael_dry",
      "next": "kella_retort"
    },
    {
      "id": "kella_retort",
      "speaker": "Kella",
      "text": "This time there's no god. Just slavers.",
      "portrait": "kella_almost_smiling",
      "next": "michael_response"
    },
    {
      "id": "michael_response",
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "text": "Somehow that's more frightening.",
      "portrait": "michael_resigned",
      "next": "slaver_island_start"
    },
    {
      "id": "slaver_island_start",
      "type": "flag_set",
      "flag": "slaver_island_unlocked",
      "next": "transition"
    },
    {
      "id": "transition",
      "type": "scene_change",
      "scene": "res://scenes/locations/slaver_island.tscn",
      "spawn": "beach_entry",
      "next": "end"
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "end"
    }
  ]
}
